{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43414","headline":"留赠偃师主人 · 无名氏","name":"留赠偃师主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤城漏未残，徒侣拂征鞍。\n洛北去愁远，淮南归梦阑。\n晓灯回壁暗，晴雪卷帘寒。\n更尽主人酒，出门行路难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}